{"id":"500348","name":"巴戟杜仲鹿筋汤","author":"elmonte","authorId":"266491","desc":"","cover":"images/500348/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鹿筋","amount":"60g"},{"name":"巴戟","amount":"30g"},{"name":"杜仲","amount":"60g"},{"name":"牛膝","amount":"60g"},{"name":"瘦肉","amount":"500g"},{"name":"红枣","amount":"10颗"},{"name":"枸杞子","amount":"手抓1把"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜","amount":"1小块"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鹿筋用水泡1个晚上。","img":"images/500348/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"巴戟杜仲清洗干净。","img":"images/500348/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"牛膝也叫牛七洗干净。","img":"images/500348/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"红枣去核。","img":"images/500348/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"姜去皮切片或拍扁。","img":"images/500348/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"瘦肉出血水。","img":"images/500348/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"鹿筋也飞水。","img":"images/500348/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"电压力锅注入水到8杯的刻度。","img":"images/500348/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"把以上的材料放入，按保汤键开煮。","img":"images/500348/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"枸杞子洗净。","img":"images/500348/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"汤煲好，自然排气后打开盖子，把枸杞子放入盖上盖子保温焖15分钟。","img":"images/500348/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"用电压力锅煲汤快捷方便，还解决老火汤嘌呤的问题。","img":"images/500348/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}